        "reference": "Romans 16:19",
        "book": "Romans",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And the God of peace shall bruise Satan under your feet shortly. The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you. Amen.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 20,
            "text": "Moro. 7:3 (3–4)."
          },
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "GR break the power of, crush. Gen. 3:15. TG Jesus Christ, Prophecies about; Redemption."
          },
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 39,
            "text": "TG Devil."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 100,
            "end": 102
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [
